      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "separate：separateAfromB分离；borrow借/deserve应得/accuse控告不表分类分开。"
    },
    {
      "number": 11,
      "stem": "In the 1975 story, she promised that she ____ write again before the summer ended.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "is"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "had"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "would"
        ],
        [
