        ]
      ],
      "answer": "C",
      "rationale": "would：过去promised所引未来wouldwrite；has/had需written，is不能接write。"
    },
    {
      "number": 12,
      "stem": "They reached a point ____ neither side was willing to continue the argument.",
      "options": [
        [
          "A",
          "whom"
        ],
        [
          "B",
          "where"
        ],
        [
          "C",
          "whose"
        ],
        [
          "D",
          "which"
        ]
      ],
      "answer": "B",
      "rationale": "where：point抽象阶段用where，从句无缺名词成分；which缺介词，whose需名词，whom人宾格不合。"
    },
    {
      "number": 13,
      "stem": "The boxes ____ against the wall ____ to the theatre group.",
